  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 25 St Peters Triangle Precinct 25\n\nClause 9.25.1 - heritage (heritage): This precinct contains the Goodsell Estate Heritage Conservation Area and Lackey Street & Simpson Park, St Peters Heritage Conservation Area.\n\nClause 9.25.2 - height_limit (development_control): To provide building heights to fit the context with restricted heights on narrower streets and laneways and taller buildings along the Princes Highway, May Street and Campbell Street.\n\nClause 9.25.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified values of the Goodsell Estate Heritage Conservation Area .\n\n",
